Music
The following royalty-free tracks were sourced from FreePD.com and are used under their public domain or royalty-free terms. Thank you to these talented composers:

“Slice of Life” – Written by Bryan Teoh
A lighthearted piece that sets the tone for a day-in-the-life intro.

“Magic in the Garden” – Written by Rafael Krux
A whimsical and magical track featuring light clarinet work.

“Forest Frolic Loop” – Written by Kevin MacLeod
Cheerful and fantastical, perfect for an enchanted setting or tutorial level.

“Connecting Rainbows” – Written by Kevin MacLeod
A nostalgic and relaxing piece centered around Celtic harp melodies.

All tracks are used in accordance with their free-to-use status on FreePD.com for commercial and non-commercial purposes.
